        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "s3_1",
            "speaker": "JULIE",
            "text": "OK. So where exactly is that?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_2",
            "speaker": "GREG",
            "text": "It's quite near the station, on Chastons Road.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_3",
            "speaker": "JULIE",
            "text": "Sorry?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_4",
            "speaker": "GREG",
            "text": "Chastons Road - that's C-H-A-S-T-O-N-S.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_5",
            "speaker": "JULIE",
            "text": "OK, thanks. So what would the work involve? Dealing with enquiries from",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_6",
            "speaker": "SPEAKER",
            "text": "patients?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_7",
            "speaker": "GREG",
            "text": "Yes, and you'd also be involved in making appointments, whether face to face or on the phone. And rescheduling them if necessary.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_8",
            "speaker": "JULIE",
            "text": "Fine, that shouldn't be a problem.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_9",
            "speaker": "GREG",
            "text": "And another of your duties would be keeping the centre's database up-to-date. Then you might have other general administrative duties as well, but those would be the main ones.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_10",
            "speaker": "JULIE",
            "text": "OK.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_11",
            "speaker": "GREG",
            "text": "Now when the details came in, I immediately thought of you because one thing they do require is someone with experience, and you did mention your work at the sports centre when you came in to see us.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_12",
            "speaker": "JULIE",
            "text": "Yes, in fact I enjoyed that job. Is there anything else they're looking for?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_13",
            "speaker": "GREG",
            "text": "Well, they say it's quite a high-pressure environment, they're always very busy,and patients are often under stress, so they want someone who can cope with",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_14",
            "speaker": "SPEAKER",
            "text": "that and stay calm, and at the same time be confident when interacting with the public.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_15",
            "speaker": "JULIE",
            "text": "Well, after dealing with three children all under five, I reckon I can cope with that.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_16",
            "speaker": "GREG",
            "text": "I'm sure you can.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_17",
            "speaker": "SPEAKER",
            "text": "And then another thing they mention is that they're looking for someone with good IT skills ...",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
        ],
